WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.100
The brief starts with the result requested and the existing constraint. Put

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.200
the supplier conflict beside the diary facts so the reader can see

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.300
why a decision is needed.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:17.258
Compare feasible options, recommend one and explain why. Name the decision required.

00:00:17.258 --> 00:00:21.983
Then list unresolved approval and acceptance conditions rather than presenting them as

00:00:21.983 --> 00:00:26.708
settled facts.

00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:31.183
Write your own first brief before opening the later case update. You

00:00:31.183 --> 00:00:35.433
will compare it with subsequent confirmed information, without pretending that you knew

00:00:35.433 --> 00:00:39.683
those later facts at the start.
